<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT LITHUANIA 3-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT LITHUANIA 3-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>TERESINA, Brazil 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Lithuania</p>
<p>3-1 (halftime 2-1) in a friendly soccer international on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brazil - Ronaldo (14th, 45th and 70th minutes)</p>
<p>Lithuania - Buitkus (21st)</p>
<p>Attendance; 60,000</p>
</text>
